  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bilateral programmme with Serbia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bilateral cooperation with Serbia. Individual projects will be granted after agreed procedures of call for proposals and joint assessment.

In 2020, unused 767.040 NOK were reprogrammed and used for project:  Response to Covid-19 crisis in Serbia implemented by UNDP with Ministry of Interior as the final beneficiary. This consists of procurement of materials and supplies urgently needed to suppress transmission, stop the pandemic and support to counter Covid-19 crisis to the Government of Serbia.</narrative>
  </description>
